%% Telegram long polling and supported notifications; not a provider CI test.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Cliente
    participant Telegram as Telegram Bot API
    participant Bot as Python ChatEngine / Dispatcher
    participant API as ChatController
    participant Service as ChatService / MissionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Cliente->>Telegram: sends plate / location / problem
    Telegram-->>Bot: long-poll update
    Bot->>API: POST /chat/lookup-targa (Bearer)
    API->>Service: lookup and limiter
    Service->>DB: read customer
    API-->>Bot: lookup result
    Bot->>API: POST /chat/missioni (requestId)
    API->>Service: create idempotent mission
    Service->>DB: persist mission and chat recipient
    API-->>Bot: mission code and state
    Bot-->>Telegram: confirmation
    Service->>DB: transaction writes outbox on accepted/completed
    Bot->>API: GET /chat/notifiche?canale=telegram
    API->>DB: read pending messages
    API-->>Bot: notification payloads
    Bot->>Telegram: send message
    Bot->>API: POST /chat/notifiche/{id}/esito
    API->>DB: persist send result
    Telegram-->>Cliente: accepted / completed update
